{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00973",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 18.45,
      "duration_seconds": 17.41,
      "text": "Good morning. I've got my phone with the photos, if that helps. I'd like a proper review of my skincare regime, because the scarring is bothering me more than the new breakouts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.82,
      "end_seconds": 28.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.72,
      "text": "Please show me. While I look, tell me what you're using at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.22,
      "end_seconds": 47.1,
      "duration_seconds": 15.88,
      "text": "Adapalene gel, once a day, at night. Benzoyl peroxide gel, in the morning. Lymecycline, 408 mg, once a day. Azelaic acid cream, twice a day. And a moisturiser, CeraVe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.91,
      "end_seconds": 55.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "That's a thorough routine. Are you finding the combination irritating?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.83,
      "end_seconds": 63.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "No peeling, no stinging, which surprised me. The dryness is fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.05,
      "end_seconds": 67.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "And what's changed recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.63,
      "end_seconds": 77.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "New spots, on the jawline. About three weeks of them, mostly before my period."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.02,
      "end_seconds": 84.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.38,
      "end_seconds": 88.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Trimethoprim. My lips swelled up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.68,
      "end_seconds": 94.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Noted. Tell me about your skin history."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.31,
      "end_seconds": 104.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "Acne since I was fourteen. Polycystic ovaries, diagnosed at twenty. And eczema as a child."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.63,
      "end_seconds": 108.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "What do you do for work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.13,
      "end_seconds": 116.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "I'm a pharmacist, so I'm quite fussy about my regime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.73,
      "end_seconds": 122.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "And diet, anything you've cut out?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.25,
      "end_seconds": 129.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Dairy free, for two years. It helped a little, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.35,
      "end_seconds": 150.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "Let me take two numbers while we talk. Blood pressure 112 over 70, pulse 66."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.8,
      "end_seconds": 154.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "That's normal for me. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.61,
      "end_seconds": 166.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "Now, the photographs. Let me swipe through. You're quite right that the scarring is the main thing. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.83,
      "end_seconds": 173.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Mostly on the cheeks. Some of them are quite deep. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.59,
      "end_seconds": 184.95,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "Scarring is hard to treat, and the most important thing is to stop new scars forming. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.08,
      "end_seconds": 192.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "That's why I'm doing all of this. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.98,
      "end_seconds": 200.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "How long have you been on the lymecycline? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.86,
      "end_seconds": 206.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Five months. I know it's meant to be limited. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.9,
      "end_seconds": 216.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Exactly. Antibiotics for acne are usually kept to three to six months, to avoid resistance. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.92,
      "end_seconds": 223.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "I wondered if I should come off it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.82,
      "end_seconds": 232.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "I think you've done the right thing by asking. Let's talk about what comes next. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.03,
      "end_seconds": 238.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Is there an alternative? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.6,
      "end_seconds": 254.09,
      "duration_seconds": 12.49,
      "text": "There are options, including hormonal treatments that suit people with polycystic ovaries, and a stronger oral treatment. We'd discuss each carefully. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.01,
      "end_seconds": 259.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Hormonal, perhaps. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.3,
      "end_seconds": 271.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "text": "Let's not decide today. For now, stay on everything you're doing, and don't stop the antibiotic suddenly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.94,
      "end_seconds": 275.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Fine. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.0,
      "end_seconds": 286.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "Take photos in the same light every two weeks, so we can see whether the scars are improving."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.81,
      "end_seconds": 290.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "I'll do that. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.95,
      "end_seconds": 297.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Use a high-factor sunscreen daily. Sun darkens scars."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.83,
      "end_seconds": 300.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Always. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.2,
      "end_seconds": 307.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in eight weeks, with the photos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.7,
      "end_seconds": 313.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Eight weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
    }
  ]
}
